WEBVTT

00:03.080 --> 00:04.920
Hey, Cid!
Cid, dude, wake up!

00:05.250 --> 00:07.210
Today is the perfect day to pick up chicks!

00:07.750 --> 00:09.540
Today our lucky chance will be...

00:09.920 --> 00:11.670
...with working older women!

00:11.670 --> 00:13.250
So come on, Cid!

00:13.250 --> 00:15.170
Let's go pick up chicks!
Let's go find some ladies!<b></b>

00:15.750 --> 00:16.750
Huh?

00:17.290 --> 00:18.540
He's not here.

00:18.540 --> 00:21.080
And he didn't lock his door.
That's careless.

00:22.750 --> 00:27.210
And here it's finally our chance to score some dates
with the lovely ladies of Mitsugoshi.

00:31.000 --> 00:32.750
