00:35.710 --> 00:39.250
These items are so premium, not even the
highest ranking nobles can get them!

00:39.250 --> 00:41.290
What would Cid be doing with them?

00:41.290 --> 00:42.500
No, wait!

00:43.130 --> 00:47.710
Even rich dudes can't get these special tickets, right?
If we show them to some girls...

00:48.790 --> 00:51.960
The odds of our chick hunt succeeding
will go through the roof!

00:51.960 --> 00:54.580
You mean, we might even get somewhere
with the glamorous girls of Mitsugoshi?

00:54.580 --> 00:57.880
When you're gonna date a glamour girl,
a high-end resort is just part of the package!

00:59.460 --> 01:00.670
How many are there?

01:00.670 --> 01:02.170
Looks like six tickets.

01:03.630 --> 01:05.670
Assuming three of them are for girls...

01:05.670 --> 01:07.080
One is for me.

01:07.080 --> 01:08.290
Another is for me.

01:08.290 --> 01:10.130
What about the last one?

01:10.130 --> 01:11.330
An extra one for me.

01:15.500 --> 01:17.580
This is it!

01:18.420 --> 01:20.750
Excuse me, lovely lady!

01:20.750 --> 01:23.330
We're going to a hot spring resort!

01:23.330 --> 01:26.710
Would you like to join us?

01:23.630 --> 01:25.710
That is too late

01:25.710 --> 01:28.630
You can't catch up with a move like that anymore
Sonna te ja mou oitsukenai<b></b>

01:28.630 --> 01:30.710
That is to say...

01:30.710 --> 01:33.500
No one can catch up now
Dare nimo mou oitsukenai<b></b>

01:41.420 --> 01:42.670
Now...

01:42.670 --> 01:44.580
I'm going to ask you one more time.

01:44.880 --> 01:48.960
These VIP tickets were given only to a chosen few.

01:49.750 --> 01:52.130
How did these come into the possession...

01:52.790 --> 01:55.210
...of young gentlemen such as yourselves?

01:59.170 --> 02:03.920
#08 The Dragon's Tears

02:01.710 --> 02:03.630
I'm going to ask you again.

02:04.130 --> 02:06.630
How did the kind of imbecilic gentlemen

02:06.920 --> 02:09.380
who would rave like idiots
outside of our establishment

02:09.380 --> 02:12.420
come into possession of these VIP tickets?

02:12.420 --> 02:14.750
Th-th-they were gifts!

02:14.750 --> 02:15.960
Gifts?

02:16.380 --> 02:18.250
You didn't steal them or find them on the ground?

02:18.250 --> 02:19.460
Certainly not!

02:19.460 --> 02:21.000
I assure you, we took them from our friend's roo-

02:21.000 --> 02:22.210
our friend let us have them!

02:22.210 --> 02:23.670
Our good friend Cid!

02:24.130 --> 02:25.500
It's true!
Good ol' Cid!

02:25.500 --> 02:28.880
He told us to take them and ask the
ladies of Mitsugoshi out on a date!

02:30.790 --> 02:32.250
This Cid...

02:32.460 --> 02:34.380
Are you referring to the Young Master Cid Kagenou?

02:34.380 --> 02:35.710
Yes! That's the guy!

02:35.710 --> 02:37.830
My bosom buddy, Cid Kagenou!

02:38.250 --> 02:39.460
I see...

02:39.460 --> 02:42.580
By the way, Miss, do you happen to be
acquainted with our friend Cid?

02:42.580 --> 02:44.750
Oh! In that case, today can be the day
you get to be acquainted with-

02:44.750 --> 02:45.960
Shut up!
That's enough!

02:46.380 --> 02:47.420
He took the tickets we arranged for him

02:47.420 --> 02:48.290
He took the tickets we arranged for him
Maybe it was a bad idea to take them without asking.<b></b>

02:48.290 --> 02:49.540
and gave them to his classmates,
Maybe it was a bad idea to take them without asking.<b></b>

02:49.540 --> 02:50.290
and gave them to his classmates,
Don't look at me! It was your idea!<b></b>

02:50.290 --> 02:52.000
thus calling the Numbers to assemble.
Don't look at me! It was your idea!<b></b>

02:52.580 --> 02:55.580
I assume Master Cid Kagenou will
be present on this date?

02:55.580 --> 02:57.420
O-o-of course he will!

02:57.420 --> 02:58.750
H-he'll be there!
I swear!

02:58.750 --> 03:00.630
He's speaking to my heart right now, telling me so!

03:00.630 --> 03:02.880
<i>I never imagined he would use
students from the Academy like this</i>

03:02.880 --> 03:05.380
<i>to send such a complicated code.</i>

03:05.790 --> 03:08.210
<i>What does Lord Shadow really want from us?</i>

03:08.920 --> 03:11.250
<i>I shall have to seek counsel
from the Seven Shadows.</i>

03:12.790 --> 03:14.210
Um, Miss?

03:14.210 --> 03:15.830
What is your answer?

03:15.830 --> 03:17.710
About our d-d-date...

03:19.750 --> 03:21.750
It is a very appealing offer.

03:22.420 --> 03:25.040
I will take it into serious consideration as an option.

03:25.580 --> 03:28.460
So quit running your mouths off
and sit still, you little brats!

03:33.500 --> 03:34.710
I see.

03:34.920 --> 03:39.880
He gave his tickets to his classmates,
and invited Shadow Garden's Numbers.

03:39.880 --> 03:43.670
Then he has some purpose in mind,
to use the tactic of a "group date" to invite me-

03:44.330 --> 03:47.540
To invite us to join him at
Mitsugoshi Hot Springs Land.

03:49.580 --> 03:52.960
If I may ask, what is Mitsugoshi Hot Springs Land?

03:52.960 --> 03:53.960
Eta...

03:53.960 --> 03:55.170
Yeah?

03:55.170 --> 03:57.000
You designed Hot Springs Land, no?

03:58.290 --> 04:03.580
Mitsugoshi Hot Springs Land is a relaxation
resort complex set to open this coming week.

04:03.580 --> 04:06.380
With theming based around the legend of
the Dragon's Tears, this groundbreaking-

04:06.380 --> 04:09.420
Don't read the description
straight out of the brochure.

04:09.420 --> 04:11.040
The Dragon's Tears?

04:11.290 --> 04:14.330
It was something Lord Shadow
told us on that fateful day.

04:14.580 --> 04:15.790
That fateful day...

04:20.460 --> 04:22.210
Playtime is over.

04:24.960 --> 04:26.380
We've finished over here, too.

04:26.380 --> 04:28.170
All cleaned up.

04:28.830 --> 04:31.000
You can't have them.

04:31.500 --> 04:36.880
Y-you'll never have the Dragon's Tears...

04:37.210 --> 04:39.710
Those golden...

04:44.380 --> 04:45.710
What is the matter, Shadow?

04:45.710 --> 04:46.330
Is something wrong?

04:46.330 --> 04:47.080
Is something...
Is something wrong?<b></b>

04:47.080 --> 04:48.290
Oops.

04:48.920 --> 04:50.790
Do you know of the Dragon's Tears?

04:51.330 --> 04:52.790
I've heard of it.

04:53.080 --> 04:56.830
I believe there was a reference to something
like that in this region's folklore.

04:58.080 --> 05:01.210
A legend that has slumbered since ancient times.
It is salvation for the soul.

05:01.210 --> 05:02.790
Dig up the entire region.

05:03.380 --> 05:04.790
What do you mean?

05:04.790 --> 05:06.380
Surely you can see it.

05:06.830 --> 05:10.420
The dazzling radiance that fills the land...

05:10.880 --> 05:14.540
The golden tears, raining down from the heavens...

05:15.170 --> 05:17.540
Now, dig.

05:20.040 --> 05:24.040
Three days later, he left the region in a terrible hurry.

05:24.420 --> 05:27.920
Surely he is off on a crucial mission
that only he is capable of accomplishing.

05:28.250 --> 05:29.960
It's always like that with him.

05:29.960 --> 05:32.210
He always goes on ahead,
leaving the rest of us behind.

05:33.040 --> 05:36.790
But if that is his choice, we will abide by it.

05:37.250 --> 05:41.790
If he has unfinished business here,
then we will finish it in his place.

05:42.250 --> 05:44.670
But what could we possibly find here?

05:44.830 --> 05:47.670
Uh, I found something.

05:51.380 --> 05:52.580
Is this...

05:52.580 --> 05:54.750
Yes, a hot spring.

05:58.670 --> 06:00.330
And that's what happened.

06:00.540 --> 06:02.380
Oh yeah, I remember that.

06:02.380 --> 06:04.750
I think you doubled up on too many roles.

06:05.040 --> 06:08.830
In the end, all we managed was
to build the Hot Springs Land.

06:09.040 --> 06:12.210
But surely he had more in mind than
simply to soak in a hot spring.

06:12.460 --> 06:16.580
Lord Shadow did seem to be interested
in the legend of the dragon.

06:16.920 --> 06:19.880
But we didn't sense any dragon magic in the area.

06:20.040 --> 06:22.920
Then maybe the dragon was a metaphor,
and it has to do with the Cult?

06:23.250 --> 06:25.960
I believe we've already eliminated
all Cult activity in the region.

06:26.210 --> 06:29.130
With the data we currently have,
it's impossible to know for sure.

06:29.130 --> 06:30.630
That is true.

06:30.880 --> 06:33.250
But I'm sure we'll find out more

06:33.460 --> 06:35.920
if we go on this hot springs date with him.

06:39.630 --> 06:42.330
We gave him a total of six tickets.

06:43.130 --> 06:46.920
With his two school friends,
that brings our lord's party to three.

06:46.920 --> 06:49.960
Then it would be reasonable to
match him three for three.

06:49.960 --> 06:51.170
Three of us...

06:51.170 --> 06:53.500
But the question is who will go?

06:53.670 --> 06:56.290
I want to go to the hot springs with the boss.

06:56.290 --> 06:58.290
Since they asked me personally, I should be one of-

07:00.670 --> 07:03.630
You have business to attend to.
You cannot go on this mission.

07:03.880 --> 07:04.880
Isn't that right?

07:04.880 --> 07:06.080
So immature.
No, I was-<b></b>

07:06.080 --> 07:07.460
I know what this is.
Isn't that right?<b></b>

07:07.460 --> 07:08.670
It was in the Wisdom of the Shadows.
Yes, I suppose it is.<b></b>

07:08.670 --> 07:10.080
It's called power harassment.

07:10.330 --> 07:13.630
I imagine this mission will not be possible
for any but the Seven Shadows.

07:14.290 --> 07:15.290
So I will personally-

07:15.290 --> 07:16.630
Just a minute, please.

07:17.130 --> 07:21.040
Shouldn't we consider the operatives' ability
to adapt to public society?

07:21.040 --> 07:23.500
We should send someone who knows the area.

07:23.710 --> 07:26.750
Surely this mission will require someone
with the ability to manage a budget.

07:26.750 --> 07:28.500
Considering the length of the mission,

07:28.500 --> 07:31.670
I believe it calls for someone with
superior control of her magic.

07:31.670 --> 07:33.750
Wouldn't we need someone who
has the resourcefulness

07:33.750 --> 07:36.750
to adapt to any change in the situation?

07:37.040 --> 07:39.250
I'm going to the hot spring with the boss.

07:43.380 --> 07:46.000
It would appear that we have no other choice.

07:46.880 --> 07:48.710
Words are useless to us now.

07:48.710 --> 07:50.250
And there's no need to hold back.

07:50.960 --> 07:52.580
There are three positions to fill.

07:52.830 --> 07:54.380
There will be three victors.

07:54.670 --> 07:57.290
Delta is going to the hot spring with the boss.

08:00.830 --> 08:02.040
Let us begin.

08:03.250 --> 08:04.790
Seven Shadows Rock-Paper-Scissors!

08:04.790 --> 08:06.630
Rock-Paper-Scissors!

08:16.170 --> 08:17.960
It's s-so nice to meet you!

08:17.960 --> 08:19.210
I'm Skel Etal!

08:19.210 --> 08:20.920
And I'm Po Tato!

08:20.920 --> 08:22.250
I'm Natsume.

08:22.250 --> 08:23.580
I'm Zetan.

08:24.670 --> 08:25.670
That's Deltan.

08:25.670 --> 08:28.500
I hear Miss R-Renu had some urgent business?

08:28.500 --> 08:30.790
Oh, but each of you is every bit as beautiful as-

08:30.790 --> 08:32.790
You seem to be missing someone.

08:34.000 --> 08:37.210
I can't believe I'm in such close proximity
to such pretty little-

08:37.210 --> 08:40.460
I don't see Mr. Cid Kagenou with you.

08:41.750 --> 08:44.960
C-C-Cid had... Uh, yeah!
He had to c-c-cancel!

08:44.960 --> 08:47.080
No, he didn't!
He's r-running late!

08:47.080 --> 08:48.710
That's it, he'll be here later!

08:49.330 --> 08:50.630
Running late...

08:50.630 --> 08:51.960
And he will be here?

08:51.960 --> 08:53.210
Yes, of course!

08:53.210 --> 08:55.130
Hopefully for sure...

08:57.000 --> 08:58.500
Oh, is that all!

08:58.630 --> 09:01.540
In that case, you should have just said something!

09:02.580 --> 09:04.580
Then, we'll go ahead and get in the water.

09:04.580 --> 09:05.960
Let's go, mutt.

09:05.960 --> 09:07.420
Delta isn't a dog!

09:07.830 --> 09:09.880
Is it me, or was that really awkward?

09:09.880 --> 09:11.460
This is bad, Skel!

09:11.460 --> 09:14.330
An ironclad rule in dating is to have an
equal number of boys and girls!

09:14.330 --> 09:16.540
At this rate, one of them will be
stuck as a fifth wheel!

09:16.540 --> 09:17.790
Is that the problem?!

09:17.790 --> 09:19.920
Dammit, all because there's only one of me!

09:20.250 --> 09:23.830
For now, we'll just buy time by sticking with
the story that Cid will be coming later!

09:23.830 --> 09:26.460
Right! In the meantime,
we will obtain our victory!

09:26.460 --> 09:28.290
Yes, with the power of our secret weapon!

09:28.290 --> 09:29.670
This book by Count Virgin Boy,

09:29.670 --> 09:33.830
"World's Best Love Tips: Your Heart-Pounding
First Hot Springs Date Edition!"

09:35.130 --> 09:36.670
Count Virgin Boy is the legendary pickup artist

09:36.670 --> 09:38.710
who has practiced the art
28,000 times in the course of his life,

09:38.710 --> 09:42.630
and at the age of 30 earned himself
the honorable title of Wizard!

09:42.630 --> 09:44.460
We can do this!
We can win!

09:44.630 --> 09:46.130
Today is the day...

09:46.130 --> 09:47.880
...we become men!

09:57.040 --> 09:59.580
Then Shadow really isn't here.

09:59.580 --> 10:01.960
According to his schoolmates, apparently not.

10:02.290 --> 10:05.080
I don't smell the boss's scent anywhere.

10:06.000 --> 10:07.420
I have to do better.

10:07.630 --> 10:09.130
Last time, and the time before that,

10:09.130 --> 10:11.670
all I did was cause Lord Shadow more trouble.

10:12.290 --> 10:14.170
I have to accomplish something this time...

10:14.920 --> 10:15.920
My stomach hurts.

10:15.920 --> 10:17.960
That's because you snack too much.

10:18.630 --> 10:22.960
Be honest, you're relieved that Lord Shadow isn't here
to see how your unhealthy, flabby-

10:22.960 --> 10:24.330
I am not flabby!

10:25.000 --> 10:28.330
But the possibility remains that
he may not come at all.

10:28.330 --> 10:29.330
Yes.

10:29.330 --> 10:32.080
I would believe that he has entrusted
this mission entirely to us.

10:32.080 --> 10:33.290
No...

10:33.580 --> 10:35.750
Of course, it's also possible that he will be here.

10:35.750 --> 10:38.330
Which is why we all must be prepared.

10:38.880 --> 10:40.080
Do you understand?

10:43.290 --> 10:45.000
She seems awfully enthusiastic.

10:45.170 --> 10:48.330
She didn't come out looking very good
after this last incident.

10:48.330 --> 10:49.540
I won't be outdone.

10:49.540 --> 10:50.750
What is that?

10:50.750 --> 10:52.040
My newest invention.

10:54.330 --> 10:56.960
You can use magic to change its color at will.

10:57.420 --> 10:59.000
You can even make it see-through.

10:59.000 --> 11:00.210
See-through!

11:00.210 --> 11:01.750
No, see-through is not allowed.

11:01.750 --> 11:02.750
Then a string biki-

11:02.750 --> 11:03.960
Nothing too provocative.

11:03.960 --> 11:04.960
But you're wearing-

11:04.960 --> 11:06.170
Not allowed.

11:18.000 --> 11:20.670
Go to hell, she-cat!

11:26.330 --> 11:27.580
Skel!

11:29.380 --> 11:31.630
Ah, all because your pass was so freaky weird.
Skeeell!<b></b>

11:31.630 --> 11:33.790
It's your fault for dodging, she-cat.

11:34.000 --> 11:35.040
I did not dodge it.
Why...<b></b>

11:35.040 --> 11:36.540
That was a perfectly legal receive.
Why...<b></b>

11:36.790 --> 11:38.080
No, tails are against the rules!

11:38.080 --> 11:39.710
Oh, you learned the rules!

11:39.710 --> 11:41.040
Not bad, dumb dog.

11:41.040 --> 11:43.380
Who are you calling dumb, she-cat?!

11:44.920 --> 11:46.130
Honestly!

11:46.380 --> 11:48.580
What do they think they're doing?

11:48.960 --> 11:51.670
I knew I should have been chosen for this mission.

11:52.000 --> 11:53.210
It's fine.

11:53.630 --> 11:55.380
They all seem to be having fun.

11:55.580 --> 11:58.830
I don't know how long it's been since
we spent time just playing around like this.

11:59.000 --> 12:01.290
But Lord Shadow's mission...

12:01.290 --> 12:04.040
What if this was what he wanted all along?

12:04.040 --> 12:05.040
What?

12:05.040 --> 12:08.130
We have been battling continually,
never taking a minute to rest.

12:08.460 --> 12:11.290
To save the world, we had no choice.

12:11.750 --> 12:15.750
But it means we've constantly been on our guard,
with no time for mental or emotional relaxation.

12:16.290 --> 12:20.500
I wonder if he gave us this respite,
out of consideration for our well-being?

12:21.000 --> 12:22.380
Would Lord Shadow...

12:22.830 --> 12:24.420
I'm just speculating,

12:24.420 --> 12:26.500
thinking about the possibilities.

12:27.170 --> 12:31.210
Whatever he is thinking is always
above my ability to comprehend.

12:33.210 --> 12:34.920
Do you foresee any problems?

12:35.130 --> 12:39.380
Other than Nu using her paid vacation time at
just the wrong time, no, not in particular.

12:39.540 --> 12:40.750
I see one.

12:41.210 --> 12:42.210
Eta!

12:42.210 --> 12:44.540
I just picked up an abnormal magical signature,

12:44.960 --> 12:46.290
deep underground.

12:46.830 --> 12:47.830
You know...

12:47.830 --> 12:50.960
I don't remember anything that happened after
they asked me to play beach volleyball.

12:51.580 --> 12:55.000
I don't even know the first thing about
how I got to be lying here like this.

12:55.000 --> 12:56.290
Where are the girls?

12:56.290 --> 12:58.330
They went to the girls' bath.

12:58.330 --> 12:59.540
Girls' bath?

13:00.170 --> 13:01.670
I thought this place had mixed bathing.

13:01.670 --> 13:05.460
Mitsugoshi Hot Springs Land caters to
any and all of its customers' needs,

13:05.460 --> 13:07.880
and offers everything including
private family baths, childrens' baths,

13:07.880 --> 13:10.750
and gender-segregated swimsuit-free baths.

13:10.920 --> 13:12.580
You really know your stuff.

13:12.580 --> 13:13.580
Wait...

13:13.580 --> 13:16.000
We came here on a date,
and they specifically went to the girls' bath.

13:16.000 --> 13:17.830
Does that mean they're avoiding us?

13:18.630 --> 13:19.880
Just the opposite.

13:19.880 --> 13:22.330
According to Count Virgin Boy:

13:22.330 --> 13:25.130
"When girls leave the table at a group date,

13:25.130 --> 13:28.830
it's to discuss who gets which boy,
so there's no overlap."

13:28.830 --> 13:30.790
So in fact, this is good news.

13:30.790 --> 13:32.250
And furthermore...

13:32.250 --> 13:33.500
Furthermore?

13:33.500 --> 13:35.710
According to Count Virgin Boy:

13:35.710 --> 13:39.040
"Since ancient times, when men and women
are divided at a hot spring,

13:39.040 --> 13:41.130
there is a tradition that must be upheld!"

13:41.960 --> 13:43.290
You don't mean...

13:43.290 --> 13:44.920
Yes, I do mean!

13:57.380 --> 13:58.960
You don't think we're...

14:00.210 --> 14:01.540
There is no doubt in my mind.

14:02.460 --> 14:04.330
We're just playing around!

14:05.330 --> 14:06.710
This won't do at all, Beta.

14:06.710 --> 14:08.710
If you don't do something,
it will be the end of another mission

14:08.710 --> 14:11.040
where all you were was a delicate
and lovely elven princess.

14:11.040 --> 14:12.290
That's your problem, you know.

14:12.290 --> 14:14.040
You couldn't help it.

14:14.290 --> 14:16.710
Treasure hunting is really hard work.

14:16.920 --> 14:20.330
And you guys aren't Delta,
so it's just too much for you.

14:20.330 --> 14:22.710
The stupid mutt's babblings aside,

14:22.710 --> 14:26.080
I think we're going to have to rethink
what our lord's objective really is.

14:26.080 --> 14:27.670
Lord Shadow's...
Delta isn't a mutt!<b></b>

14:28.130 --> 14:31.130
What I keep coming back to is the Dragon's Tears.

14:32.130 --> 14:33.540
The Dragon's Tears...

14:35.670 --> 14:39.460
Once upon a time, there lived in this land
a kind and gentle princess.

14:40.130 --> 14:44.080
One day, the princess rescued a small dragon
that had been separated from its clutch.

14:45.080 --> 14:49.420
The princess and the dragon became fast friends,
and they grew up together.

14:50.380 --> 14:53.750
But their days of peace and happiness
eventually came to an end...

14:54.630 --> 14:56.630
for war had broken out.

14:57.170 --> 14:59.420
The dragon fought to protect the princess,

14:59.420 --> 15:03.290
fending off one hundred thousand soldiers
despite being afflicted with deep wounds.

15:03.880 --> 15:07.330
But when the dragon returned to find the princess,

15:07.330 --> 15:09.670
all that remained of the royal capital was ruins.

15:10.040 --> 15:12.130
In the castle, the princess was
about to breathe her last.

15:12.130 --> 15:13.420
The dragon said to her...

15:13.750 --> 15:15.750
"Your Highness, please open your eyes.

15:15.750 --> 15:17.630
Let us soar through the skies together once more."

15:18.080 --> 15:23.920
Just then, a single tear fell from
the princess' lifeless visage.

15:24.750 --> 15:27.000
"Please, Your Highness, don't cry."

15:27.710 --> 15:30.210
The dragon, in turn, began to weep uncontrollably.

15:30.750 --> 15:35.080
Hot tears flooded the land,
covering the entire kingdom.

15:36.750 --> 15:38.500
The princess awoke to find

15:38.500 --> 15:41.830
a mysterious spring of warm water,
filled with the essence of life.

15:42.670 --> 15:45.790
But the dragon was nowhere to be seen.

15:46.380 --> 15:48.380
The princess called the dragon's name.

15:48.880 --> 15:52.790
Her voice merely echoed throughout
the uninhabited sky.

15:54.250 --> 15:59.290
It may be that what our lord truly seeks
is hidden somewhere inside this tale.

15:59.540 --> 16:02.080
That was a pretty good performance, Lambda.

16:02.540 --> 16:04.420
Then is it the water you think
we should be focusing on?

16:04.420 --> 16:07.420
But according to all our research,
it's just a normal hot spring.

16:08.170 --> 16:10.080
Can you see them yet?

16:10.420 --> 16:12.170
Almost there...

16:15.170 --> 16:17.250
We can't use magic or they'll catch us.

16:17.250 --> 16:20.040
But we have our white-hot friendship.

16:20.500 --> 16:22.460
According to Count Virgin Boy:

16:22.460 --> 16:23.880
"The bold men"...

16:23.880 --> 16:26.250
..."get the chicks!"

16:28.420 --> 16:30.080
We may not be able to do it alone.

16:30.750 --> 16:33.460
But together, we can break the curse...

16:33.750 --> 16:35.170
...of our virginity!

16:40.460 --> 16:42.750
Nothing is impossible for the
Wisdom of the Shadows.

16:44.080 --> 16:45.540
My eyes! My eyes!

16:45.540 --> 16:49.080
Salty! Salty! Salty!
My eyes! My eyes!<b></b>

16:59.380 --> 17:00.630
What are you doing?

17:00.630 --> 17:02.580
I detected that magic again.

17:03.540 --> 17:04.750
This way.

17:05.250 --> 17:07.670
The hot spring is reacting to tears...

17:07.670 --> 17:08.670
I think?

17:08.670 --> 17:11.790
If I remember correctly, we did pull the water
for this hot spring from underground.

17:15.000 --> 17:16.630
The reaction isn't any stronger.

17:16.630 --> 17:18.000
That's going a bit too far.

17:18.000 --> 17:20.750
They are technically Lord Shadow's
schoolmates, you know.

17:20.750 --> 17:22.580
And the underground readings...

17:23.000 --> 17:25.130
I don't know what significance the
underground has to anything,

17:25.130 --> 17:26.460
but if we're talking about tears...

17:26.830 --> 17:29.080
In the legend, it was the princess' tears.

17:30.000 --> 17:31.460
Wh-what?!

17:31.750 --> 17:34.380
Self-proclaimed lovely elven princess...

17:35.130 --> 17:36.630
S-so what if I am?

17:36.630 --> 17:39.290
The Wisdom of the Shadows
always requires a sacrifice.

17:41.000 --> 17:43.420
What is going on here?!

17:43.420 --> 17:45.920
Yes, that is a princess in distress, for sure.

17:45.920 --> 17:48.290
Stop being clever and help me!

17:48.290 --> 17:49.500
Now then...

17:49.710 --> 17:51.500
Wh-wh-what is that?

17:51.500 --> 17:55.040
An artifact that you insert into the rear end
to improve bowel function.

17:55.040 --> 17:56.250
I might want that-

17:56.250 --> 17:58.580
Wait, how is that an artifact?!

17:58.830 --> 18:02.710
Its side effects include excessive leakage
from every orifice in the body.

18:02.710 --> 18:05.250
Try making something less horrible!

18:05.420 --> 18:06.420
Grr...

18:06.420 --> 18:07.630
Wh-wh-what?

18:07.630 --> 18:10.790
This is the trouble with airheads whose nourishment
only ever goes to their chest.

18:11.000 --> 18:14.500
I don't suppose you'd mind if I remodeled you
until you're nothing but a beat-up old rag.

18:14.830 --> 18:18.830
The Master even said, "I hate pick-mes," after all.

18:19.670 --> 18:20.880
Probably.

18:21.130 --> 18:23.960
He said he's fed up with silver-haired elves
who are obviously faking it.

18:23.960 --> 18:25.210
Is that part of the Wisdom of the Shadows, too?

18:25.210 --> 18:26.080
Is that part of the Wisdom of the Shadows, too?
Lies! You're lying to me to get me to cry!<b></b>

18:26.080 --> 18:28.250
Yes, it's the "drill sergeant" method of training
Lies! You're lying to me to get me to cry!<b></b>

18:28.250 --> 18:30.330
new recruits by putting them down constantly
You were lucky enough to get chosen for this mission,<b></b>

18:30.330 --> 18:31.210
new recruits by putting them down constantly
but you've been totally useless.<b></b>

18:31.210 --> 18:33.790
until they do what you want them to.

18:33.790 --> 18:36.420
Hmm, I feel like she really means it, too, though.
I suspect he might be done with you soon.<b></b>

18:36.630 --> 18:37.830
Why?

18:38.710 --> 18:41.710
How can you say such terrible things to me?

18:42.080 --> 18:45.250
I'm trying... I'm trying...

18:46.130 --> 18:49.830
I'm trying just as hard as the rest of you!

18:54.790 --> 18:56.040
This magical energy...

18:56.040 --> 18:58.540
Ow ow ow!
Uncle! Uncle! Uncle!

19:05.210 --> 19:06.460
This is terrible!

19:06.750 --> 19:08.670
Escort the guests to safety! Quickly!

19:08.920 --> 19:11.210
Is this what Shadow was trying to tell us?

19:11.420 --> 19:12.790
Lady Alpha,
Come on, stop crying.<b></b>

19:12.790 --> 19:14.500
if we don't do something,
it will damage the facility!

19:14.710 --> 19:16.130
We can't just stand here.

19:16.330 --> 19:17.540
Let's go, everyone!

19:17.540 --> 19:18.540
Right!
Right...<b></b>

19:22.630 --> 19:24.130
Huh? These colors...

19:24.130 --> 19:27.080
We can't let the public know
we are Shadow Garden.

19:27.580 --> 19:30.000
Delta is going in first!

19:31.040 --> 19:32.250
Me, too!

19:33.080 --> 19:34.290
We're all going in!

19:34.540 --> 19:35.750
You can count on me-

19:38.790 --> 19:40.290
Continue the attack! Don't let up!
Take that and that and that...<b></b>

19:40.290 --> 19:41.290
It's not over yet!
Take that and that and that...<b></b>

19:41.290 --> 19:43.250
I'm trying just as hard as the rest of you!
Take that and that and that...<b></b>

19:43.540 --> 19:44.960
And that and that!

19:47.580 --> 19:51.000
Goodbye, o tragic dragon of antiquity.

20:02.250 --> 20:04.920
Golden tears, raining down from the heavens...

20:04.920 --> 20:06.130
This is it!

20:06.130 --> 20:07.880
This is what our lord was looking for!

20:09.830 --> 20:11.040
No doubt about it.

20:11.040 --> 20:14.000
The hot springs have been imbued
with magical properties.

20:14.000 --> 20:15.630
A new business opportunity!

20:15.630 --> 20:18.920
They can now improve beauty, health,

20:18.920 --> 20:20.380
I'm trying just as hard as the rest of them.
high blood pressure, constipation...<b></b>

20:20.380 --> 20:20.920
I'm trying just as hard as the rest of them.
Any bust enhancing properties?<b></b>

20:20.920 --> 20:21.290
It's always so hard to take first place.
Any bust enhancing properties?<b></b>

20:21.290 --> 20:21.920
It's always so hard to take first place.
No.<b></b>

20:21.920 --> 20:22.920
It's always so hard to take first place.
Any bust enhancing properties?<b></b>

20:22.920 --> 20:24.130
It's always so hard to take first place.
Face reality.<b></b>

20:33.420 --> 20:38.210
I'm sure Shadow wanted to rescue the soul
of that kind and gentle dragon.

20:39.540 --> 20:42.580
Now, are you ready to add the last finishing touch?

20:43.710 --> 20:47.580
I hope you enjoyed our special event based on
the Dragon's Tears Hot Spring!

20:47.580 --> 20:51.420
Now, please feel welcome to purchase our new,
limited edition, grand opening merchandise!

20:51.630 --> 20:54.960
Today only, we're offering a special discount
if you buy the entire set!

20:55.380 --> 20:57.080
Um, I took today off...

20:57.750 --> 20:59.000
Take a comp day.

20:59.580 --> 21:00.920
It looks like everything worked out well.

21:00.920 --> 21:03.580
Yes! And the facility was only lightly damaged.

21:22.540 --> 21:24.540
Thank you for the wonderful day off...

21:25.830 --> 21:27.040
Shadow.

21:39.710 --> 21:44.750
People say there is no night with no dawn
Akenai yoru nante nai tte iu keredo<b></b>

21:44.750 --> 21:49.170
But I would think it's better without a dawn
Akenakute ii to, sou omotteta<b></b>

21:49.630 --> 21:52.000
The scars we want to hide
Kakushitai kizuato datte<b></b>

21:52.000 --> 21:54.670
All the memories we want to forget
Wasuretai kioku mo minna<b></b>

21:55.080 --> 21:59.830
The sun shines light on all of them
Taiyou wa zenbu terashidasu kara<b></b>

22:00.710 --> 22:02.500
Looking for falling stars
Ryuusei o sagashi<b></b>

22:03.250 --> 22:05.170
I would wander
Samayottetanda yo<b></b>

22:05.920 --> 22:12.920
Until the moment I met you
Anata to deau toki made<b></b>

22:14.500 --> 22:19.830
Those stars that twinkle in the sky
Sora ni matataku ano hoshi ga<b></b>

22:19.830 --> 22:25.210
Lead to a path of hope, I'll go to the end of it
Tsunaida kibou no michi no saki e yukou<b></b>

22:25.210 --> 22:30.080
I can go forward with no more uncertainty
Mou mayowazu ni susumeru<b></b>

22:30.080 --> 22:36.420
I'll chase after the prayers that traverse the dark night
Kurai yoru o koeru inori o oikaketeku<b></b>

22:36.420 --> 22:40.880
Because even if I can't reach you yet
Tatoe mada todokanaku tatte<b></b>

22:41.670 --> 22:44.960
I still want to tell you
Tsutaetai kara<b></b>

22:44.960 --> 22:46.540
Thank you
Arigatou<b></b>

23:01.040 --> 23:04.420
You know, I don't remember a single thing
that happened all day.

23:04.420 --> 23:07.540
What a coincidence.
Neither do I.

23:08.170 --> 23:11.420
But according to Count Virgin Boy,

23:11.420 --> 23:16.130
"Boys, to become a man means to be reborn," after all.

23:16.630 --> 23:21.420
Uh, so you're saying, in exchange for becoming men,
we lost our memories?

23:21.830 --> 23:25.250
This is a giant leap for male virgins.

23:25.250 --> 23:28.330
But for men, it's just the first small step.

23:29.040 --> 23:30.670
We won't be stopped.

23:30.670 --> 23:32.790
No, we will keep going forward!

23:33.420 --> 23:35.330
Our celibatory journey...

23:35.580 --> 23:37.040
starts now!
